# Intent
Build TinyWins' goal-aware Coach screen. It moves a user from stuck through a
user-started micro-step timer into the shared check-in and honest result flow.

# Requirements
- Read `goalId`, create a browser-session `sessionId`, and auto-send one
  starter message per goal.
- Implement `chatting → microStepReady → timing → interview → submitting →
  result`.
- Start timers only from the user's button gesture; keep TTS inactive in P0.
- Render approach feedback only when the server sets `showApproachCheckIn`.
- Reuse `CheckInFlow` and `CheckInResultCard`.

# Interfaces
Use `CoachReply`, `sendCoachMessage`, `sendCoachFeedback`, and `CheckInResult`
from `src/lib/ui-data.ts`.

# Output
`src/app/coach/page.tsx`

# Acceptance criteria
- A Coach without `goalId` never exposes completion.
- Repeated curt-reply behavior is server-owned through `sessionId`.
- Live failures remain labeled and never manufacture a micro-step.
